gtnhadjust.reshaping.EOHB_Starry_Miracle_Project=§6♢ §3§o§lEOHB — Starry Miracle Project §6✦
gtnhadjust.reshaping.EOHB_Text_SeparatingLine=-----------------------------------------
gtnhadjust.reshaping.Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_00=Void begets all things, and chaos forges gods. All matter can be reshaped, but great power cannot be defied.
gtnhadjust.reshaping.Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_01=The laws of the universe are both a cage and a shackle. All things follow the path of entropy—life will inevitably decay, stars will burn out, and dust will return to dust. But we refuse to accept this fate.
gtnhadjust.reshaping.Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_02=They are nameless entities, echoes from beyond reality, remnants we brought back from the unknown when we tampered with the laws of the universe.
gtnhadjust.reshaping.Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_03=We are the creators of stars, the manipulators of reality, and the ultimate masters of gravity!
gtnhadjust.reshaping.Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_04=Some particles exhibit arrangements that defy known physical rules, some substances exist in ways that violate the laws of thermodynamics.
gtnhadjust.reshaping.Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_05=and some creations… vanish the moment we attempt to document them, as if they never existed at all.
gtnhadjust.reshaping.Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_06=The machine supports cross-recipe parallel processing!
gtnhadjust.reshaping.Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_07=Supports up to 10 recipes running simultaneously! The optimal ratio for each recipe is 10*10!
gtnhadjust.reshaping.Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_08=If any recipe exceeds 10 units in operation, it will cause a decrease in total parallel efficiency!
gtnhadjust.reshaping.Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_09=But remember this—creators are also destroyers.
gtnhadjust.reshaping.Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_10="When the gods fall silent, mortals may seize the mantle of power. But remember, the mantle was never truly ours to claim."
gtnhadjust.reshaping.StructureTooComplex=The structure is too complex!
